OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Afatal stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal stabbing.
OL,9,FDean Fishwick, 51, died in hospital
OL,10,Fafter being found injured at a property
OL,11,Fon Thames Road in Peterlee shortly
OL,12,Fbefore midnight on Wednesday.
OL,14,FKenneth Fishwick, 53 and also from
OL,15,FPeterlee, has been charged with murder
OL,16,Fand remanded into custody, Durham
OL,17,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
