OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Afatal stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the force said a
OL,7,F73-year-old woman arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof murder had been bailed, while a
OL,9,F77-year-old man previously arrested for
OL,10,Fthe same offence had been released
OL,11,Funder investigation.
